# Which icon source becomes which Compose ImageVector.
#
#   python tools/svg_to_vector.py --map tools/icons.map
#
# Sources live in additional/icons/ and are named after what the icon is for, not after whatever
# the download was called. Destinations are generated Kotlin under core/designsystem, one file per
# icon, each declaring `val SaxTrainerIcons.<Name>` - so adding or replacing an icon never touches
# a screen. Do not edit a destination by hand; regenerate it.
#
# Downloading from fonts.google.com/icons: format SVG, size 24px, weight 400, grade 0, optical
# size 24, and one style throughout. Colour does not matter - icons are drawn through
# Icon(imageVector, tint = ...), which replaces the fill with the theme colour.
#
# Drawing your own in Inkscape: document 24x24 px (or any square), then before saving
#   1. Path > Object to Path            turns rectangles, circles and text into paths
#   2. Path > Stroke to Path            turns outlines into filled shapes
#   3. Path > Union                     flattens overlapping shapes, and drops group transforms
#   4. Save As > Plain SVG              no Inkscape-specific attributes
# The converter refuses anything it would get wrong - transforms, gradients, strokes, non-path
# shapes - and says which one it found, so a bad export fails loudly instead of shipping crooked.
#
# Notation glyphs are not icons and are not listed here. They are anchored to a staff line rather
# than to a 24x24 viewport, which is something this pipeline has no way to say, and they are traced
# from a music font rather than drawn: see tools/bravura_glyphs.py, which writes
# core/designsystem/.../component/BravuraGlyphs.kt. The shapes are Bravura's, by Steinberg Media
# Technologies GmbH, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; only the outlines are used, and no font
# is shipped or loaded at runtime.

additional/icons/settings.svg     -> core/designsystem/src/main/java/com/example/saxtrainer/core/designsystem/icon/Settings.kt
additional/icons/learning.svg     -> core/designsystem/src/main/java/com/example/saxtrainer/core/designsystem/icon/Learning.kt
additional/icons/long_tone.svg    -> core/designsystem/src/main/java/com/example/saxtrainer/core/designsystem/icon/LongTone.kt
additional/icons/arrow_back.svg   -> core/designsystem/src/main/java/com/example/saxtrainer/core/designsystem/icon/ArrowBack.kt
additional/icons/tune.svg         -> core/designsystem/src/main/java/com/example/saxtrainer/core/designsystem/icon/ChooseNotes.kt

